msgstr "Alles uitvinken"

#: gui/dialogs.py:597
msgid "No feed selected."
msgstr "Geen feed geselecteerd."

#: gui/dialogs.py:664
msgid ""
"Some websites show a browser verification page (for example a Cloudflare "
"challenge) before their feeds. To read them in BlindRSS:\n"
"1. Open the website in your web browser and wait for it to load.\n"
"2. Export its cookies with a \"cookies.txt\" browser extension.\n"
"3. Choose the exported file below.\n"
"Also paste your browser's User-Agent string (search the web for \"what is my "
"user agent\" to see it) so the site accepts the cookies."
msgstr ""
"Sommige websites tonen vóór hun feeds een browserverificatiepagina "
"(bijvoorbeeld een Cloudflare-controle). Zo leest u ze in BlindRSS:\n"
"1. Open de website in uw webbrowser en wacht tot deze is geladen.\n"
"2. Exporteer de cookies met een \"cookies.txt\"-browserextensie.\n"
"3. Kies hieronder het geëxporteerde bestand.\n"
"Plak ook de User-Agent-tekenreeks van uw browser (zoek op internet naar "
"\"what is my user agent\") zodat de site de cookies accepteert."

#: gui/dialogs.py:682
msgid "Import from &Browser..."
msgstr "Importeren uit &browser..."

#: gui/dialogs.py:688
msgid "Get the \"Get cookies.txt LOCALLY\" extension for Chrome-based browsers"
msgstr ""
"De extensie \"Get cookies.txt LOCALLY\" voor op Chrome gebaseerde browsers "
"ophalen"

#: gui/dialogs.py:705
msgid "&Browse..."
msgstr "Bladeren..."

#: gui/dialogs.py:767
msgid ""
"No supported browser profiles were found.\n"
"\n"
"Cookies can be read directly from Firefox-based browsers (Firefox, "
"LibreWolf, Waterfox, Floorp, Zen). Chrome-based browsers encrypt their "
"cookies; use the \"Get cookies.txt LOCALLY\" extension linked above and "
"import the exported file instead."
msgstr ""
"Geen ondersteunde browserprofielen gevonden.\n"
"\n"
"Cookies kunnen rechtstreeks worden gelezen uit op Firefox gebaseerde "
"browsers (Firefox, LibreWolf, Waterfox, Floorp, Zen). Op Chrome gebaseerde "
"browsers versleutelen hun cookies; gebruik de hierboven gelinkte extensie "
"\"Get cookies.txt LOCALLY\" en importeer het geëxporteerde bestand."

#: gui/dialogs.py:786
msgid "Choose the browser profile to import cookies from:"
msgstr "Kies het browserprofiel waaruit cookies moeten worden geïmporteerd:"

#: gui/dialogs.py:818
msgid "Imported {count} cookies from {browser}."
msgid_plural "Imported {count} cookies from {browser}."
msgstr[0] "{count} cookie geïmporteerd uit {browser}."
msgstr[1] "{count} cookies geïmporteerd uit {browser}."

